 "commit": {
  "author": "Azzinoth",
  "date": "2026-11-13T02:46:00Z",
  "message": "FreeCameraController now takes pitch and yaw from view direction of camera on first active frame, previously they were taken from Euler angles, which could contain 180 degrees roll, so camera that was saved facing more than 90 degrees away from default direction was flipped upside down when it was activated; Rotation of FreeCameraController no longer depends on frame time, previously mouse movement was multiplied by delta time, so camera rotated faster on lower FPS; Added FreeCameraController::MouseSensitivity script field, it is degrees of rotation per pixel of mouse movement; Rebuilt camera scripts module with these changes; FEngine::GetDeltaTime now returns time between starts of two frames, previously it was sum of CPU and GPU time, which did not include anything application does between FEngine::Render and FEngine::EndFrame, so in editor delta time was shorter than real frame by time of its user interface; Delta time of the first frame is 0.",
  "url": "https://github.com/Azzinoth/FocalEngine/commit/7c9da1abcb6bbb549a50ecacd301d7e7e8f3776c"
 },
